{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.poster.avif?t=1759382362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.webm?t=1759382362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.mp4?t=1759382362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>[h3]Build a Border Business Empire[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small checkpoint: a single barrier and empty lots.<br>Open new businesses \u2014 from a modest mini-market and pizzeria to a gas station, hotel, or cinema.<br>Each business generates income that helps you expand and upgrade your post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the barrier to speed up work, reduce waiting lines, and increase traffic flow \u2014 so the money keeps rolling in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.poster.avif?t=1759382362\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.webm?t=1759382362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.mp4?t=1759382362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>[h3]Check Vehicles \u2014 Make the Call[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you\u2019ll have to step onto the road and press the <strong>\u201cCheck\u201d</strong> button.<br>Passengers will share thei